{This is a companion workbook for Nicholas Klinichenko's book "Magnus Carlsen - Modern Chess Manual", Penelopa, 2023.   It contains all games analyzed in the book organized in chapters as per the original. Pre-game notes (shown in a frame between the game's header and the text) are also taken from the book.  The games have been sourced from ChessBase's MegaBase. Note that any comments found in them come from the MegaBase and have no relation to the content of the book.}

