{[%eval +0.11][%brsp Re6]}  Re7 {[%eval +0.38][%brsp Rec1]}  20. Rac1 $1 {[%eval +0.20][%brsp Ne8]Getting the pawn back with 20.Qxb4 was possible, but the whole concept of sacrificing a pawn in a seemingly normal position just goes to show how brilliant Carlsen is sometimes.}  
