34. fxe3 $18 {[%eval +1.16][%brsp Ne4]White is winning. With flawless technique, Carlsen converts the full point:}  
Ne4 {[%eval +1.03][%brsp Qd3]}  35. Qxd5 {[%eval +0.91][%brsp Qb1]}  Nd2 {[%eval +2.06][%assm 2][%brsp Qd3]}  
36. Qf5+ {[%eval +1.26][%brsp Kg8]}  Kh8 {[%eval +1.99][%brsp Qg4]}  37. Qg4 {[%eval +2.40][%brsp Qb1]}  
