(13. f7+ $6 {[%cbm Trying to continue similarly to the game with]}  Kd8 14. 
O-O-O {runs into}  (14. Rxg2 {[%cbm and ]}  d6 15. O-O-O Kc7 16. Bh4 Bg4 {also defends well.} 
) 14... h4 $1 15. Bxh4 Qc7 $1 {when White's attack seems too slow.} ) 13... Kd8 
