) 35. Nd4 {[%eval +1.21][%brsp Qxc4]}  Qxc4 {[%eval +1.24][%brsp Nxb3]}  36. 
Nxb3 {[%eval +1.08][%brsp Qxb3]}  Qxb3 {[%eval +1.13][%brsp Rd3]White has a material advantage. It is not easy to convert, as his king is a bit exposed. On the other hand, Black's bishop is passive and his king is not safe, either.}  
37. Qe2 {[%eval +0.97][%brsp Rb8]}  Be7 {[%eval +1.12][%brsp Kg2]}  38. Kg2 {[%eval +1.16][%brsp Rc8]}  
Qe6 {[%eval +1.33][%brsp Rd5]}  39. h5 {[%eval +1.29][%brsp Qh6]}  Ra3 {[%eval +1.55][%brsp Rd5]}  
