Rg5+ 48. Rg4 Rxh5 {might have been a bit more tenacious, but it would have been equivalent to a resignation in the match.} 
) 45. Rf5 {[%eval +2.38][%brsp Qe6]}  Qh4 {[%eval +2.66][%brsp Qxf4]}  46. Rc1 {[%eval +2.55][%brsp Rc5]}  
Ra7 {[%eval +4.05][%brsp Rc8]}  47. Qxf4 {[%eval +2.86][%brsp Qxf4]}  Ra2+ {[%eval +3.42][%brsp Kh1]}  
