c6 $5 {[%eval +0.30][%brsp Nf3] An interesting surprise by Nakamura, who has recently, at least result-wise, done quite well with 2...e6 against Magnus. But having suffered in the opening in St. Louis, as well as trying to be the first to surprise in this crucial game, Hikaru goes back to the Slav.}  
3. Nf3 {[%eval +0.25][%brsp Nf6]}  Nf6 {[%eval +0.28][%brsp e3]}  4. e3 {[%eval +0.29][%brsp Bf5]Magnus' preferred line, giving Naka his chance to spring his surprise:}  
