h3 {[%eval +0.27][%brsp Bxf3]}  Bh5 {[%eval +0.42][%brsp g4]}  6. cxd5 $5 {[%eval +0.20][%brsp Bxf3]Played after prolonged thought. It's a rare move at the top level these days, but serves the purpose of not having to face Nakamuras preparation in the main lines.}  
