Nxa4 {[%eval +35.88][%brsp Bb3]}  75. Bb3 {[%eval +38.04][%brsp Nb6]...is a simple fork, picking up one of the knights, while still keeping the 2 passed pawns, leaving Black in a hopeless position.}  
