Nc8 (80... Nxa4+ 81. Kc6 $1) 81. Bd7 Na7 82. Kb6 {White soon queens, Nakamura resigned. A lot was still to come, before Magnus had pulled of a spectacular last minute comeback, to take both the tournament and the tour, but without this win, the possibility would not have been there.} 
