) 19. Qxh6 {[%eval +0.75][%brsp Bxf2]}  Bxf2+ $1 {[%eval +0.82][%brsp Kxf2]Black sacrifices the bishop to force an exchange of queens. White cannot decline with 20.Kh1 as the bishop on f2 also threatens the white rook on h4.}  
