22. Kg1 {[%eval +0.87][%brsp Nxf6]}  Nxf6 {[%eval +0.89][%brsp Rf1]}  23. Rf1 $1 
{[%eval +0.74][%brsp Nh7]Maybe this position does not look as much, but White's  
   initiative still is very threatening. As Magnus knew the machines evaluated  
the   sacrifice on h6 as advantageous for White, and he  (correctly) saw no  
better   option than this, it meant he could enter this seemingly innocent  
position with   confidence.}  Kg7 $5 {[%eval +1.07][%brsp Rf3]Duda realized his problems, and went for a practical  solution.}  
