 {[%eval +0.23]} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 {[%eval +0.39]}  e5 $5 {[%eval +0.55]After using the Sveshnikov Variation in the WCh match and frequently in tournaments, afterwards Magnus now switched to the "Kalashnikov", curiously named after the Russian machine gun. This game explains why!}  
